```julia; echo=false, label="fig-pol-diag", fig_cap="Constraint errors per step, relative to the initial density seed. Rate form (DKNoPol, cold): quasineutrality residual max|δBz − δn|. Charge form (DKPolDensity): quasineutrality residual of the electron fluid, max|δN_e(quasineutral) − δN_e| (the corrector error), and the Faraday residual ‖Bz^{n+1}−Bz^n+dt·∂ₓEy^m‖∞ (exact by construction)."

